## Frequently asked questions

**Do you only work with Penarth businesses?**

No. We work with businesses across [South Wales](/web-design-south-wales/) and the UK, but Penarth is one of our core service areas.

**Can you help improve my Google rankings?**

Yes. Every website we build is SEO-ready from day one. We also offer dedicated [local SEO for Penarth](/seo-penarth/) for those who want to go further.

**How long does a website take?**

Most projects are completed within 7–14 days depending on scope.

**Will my website work on mobile?**

Yes. Every website we build uses mobile-first design.

**Can I update the site myself?**

Yes. We provide full access and training as part of every project.

